OL,3,A#100 energy payment for millions
OL,4,Aannounced in Budget as OBR warns
OL,5,Adisposable incomes unlikely to grow
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealey says there will be "fiscal
OL,8,Fdevolution", with business rates
OL,9,Fretained locally by the end of the
OL,10,Fdecade and mayors getting a share of
OL,11,Fincome tax from 2028
OL,13,FMeanwhile, there are tax rises on some
OL,14,Fsavings and rental profits
OL,16,FTory leader Kemi Badenoch says the
OL,17,FBudget is "not good enough, not strong
OL,18,Fenough, not bold enough", while the Lib
OL,19,FDems urge the government to "fix our
OL,20,Ftrading relationship with Europe"
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/37
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
