OL,3,ARussell Brand tells trial sexual
OL,4,Aconsent is 'fundamental'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FRussell Brand has told the jury at his
OL,10,Ftrial he believes sexual consent is
OL,11,F"fundamental" and "more important than
OL,12,Fsex itself".
OL,14,FBrand, 51, is accused of three counts
OL,15,Fof rape, three counts of sexual
OL,16,Fassault, and one charge of attempted
OL,17,Findecent assault.
OL,19,FThe allegations, made by six female
OL,20,Fcomplainants, span a 10-year period
OL,21,Fbetween 1999 and 2009. He denies all
OL,22,Fthe charges.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/37
