OL,3,AFlavio Bolsonaro seen landing in Miami
OL,4,Awith family after Brazil presidential
OL,5,Aelection defeat
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US State Department says it will
OL,8,Fissue visas to Bolsonaro and his
OL,9,Ffamily, while Trump says he'd be "okay"
OL,10,Fwith him staying there
OL,12,FWhen did this start? Bolsonaro is under
OL,13,Finvestigation for alleged corruption
OL,14,Fand money laundering, which he denies
